ef="#auth-Danielle-Celentano-Aff12" data-author-popup="auth-Danielle-Celentano-Aff12" data-author-search="Celentano, Danielle">Danielle Celentano</a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff12">12</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item c-article-author-list__item--hide-small-screen"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="14_19" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Sarah_Jane-Wilson-Aff13" data-author-popup="auth-Sarah_Jane-Wilson-Aff13" data-author-search="Wilson, Sarah Jane">Sarah Jane Wilson</a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff13">13</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item c-article-author-list__item--hide-small-screen"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="15_19" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Jonathan_R_-Rhodes-Aff2-Aff3-Aff4" data-author-popup="auth-Jonathan_R_-Rhodes-Aff2-Aff3-Aff4" data-author-search="Rhodes, Jonathan R.">Jonathan R. Rhodes</a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff2">2</a>,<a href="#Aff3">3</a>,<a href="#Aff4">4</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item c-article-author-list__item--hide-small-screen"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="16_19" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Nikola_S_-Alexandre-Aff8-Aff14" data-author-popup="auth-Nikola_S_-Alexandre-Aff8-Aff14" data-author-search="Alexandre, Nikola S.">Nikola S. Alexandre</a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff8">8</a>,<a href="#Aff14">14</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item c-article-author-list__item--hide-small-screen"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="17_19" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Do_Hyung-Kim-Aff14" data-author-popup="auth-Do_Hyung-Kim-Aff14" data-author-search="Kim, Do-Hyung">Do-Hyung Kim</a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff14">14</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item c-article-author-list__item--hide-small-screen"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="18_19" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Diego-Bastos-Aff1" data-author-popup="auth-Diego-Bastos-Aff1" data-author-search="Bastos, Diego">Diego Bastos</a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff1">1</a></sup> &amp; </li><li class="c-article-author-list__show-more" aria-label="Show all 19 authors for this article" title="Show all 19 authors for this article">…</li><li class="c-article-author-list__item"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="19_19" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Renato-Crouzeilles-Aff1-Aff5" data-author-popup="auth-Renato-Crouzeilles-Aff1-Aff5" data-author-search="Crouzeilles, Renato">Renato Crouzeilles</a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff1">1</a>,<a href="#Aff5">5</a></sup> </li></ul><button aria-expanded="false" class="c-article-author-list__button"><svg width="16" height="16" focusable="false" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="u-icon"><use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="#icon-eds-i-chevron-down-medium"></use></svg><span>Show authors</span></button>

                    

